        - Input: :math:`(N, C_{in}, D_{in}, H_{in}, W_{in})` or :math:`(C_{in}, D_{in}, H_{in}, W_{in})`
        - Output: :math:`(N, C_{out}, D_{out}, H_{out}, W_{out})` or
          :math:`(C_{out}, D_{out}, H_{out}, W_{out})`, where

